        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955904",
            "initDialog": "695590401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695590401",
                    "speaker": "早柚",
                    "text": "总算赢下来了，脑筋都要转不动了…等一下，要好好睡一觉才行…"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955905",
            "initDialog": "695590501",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695590501",
                    "speaker": "早柚",
                    "text": "在打牌这方面，我擅长的忍术完全派不上用场啊…"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955906",
            "initDialog": "695590601",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695590601",
                    "speaker": "早柚",
                    "text": "…唔，准备得差不多了。开始吧。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955908",
            "initDialog": "695590801",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695590801",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "进行「七圣召唤」的对局吧。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955909",
            "initDialog": "695590901",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695590901",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "先调整一下卡组…"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955910",
            "initDialog": "695591001",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695591001",
                    "speaker": "早柚",
                    "text": "赢、赢了？真是不容易。"
